                    <svg class="icono" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v3H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1V6a5 5 0 0 0-5-5Zm-3 8V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v3H9Z" /></svg> Mi contraseña
